{"kind":"request","text":"S4 — Distributed proof and acceptance specification. Design/specification only for the frozen 017 draft (596 lines, 40,011 bytes, SHA256 a2d1464397038bbf6ce9f61be5800fe18ee16d3df269fb64d8fcf6d01d377b2a; primary 7282ebc1637e8e08f251efb25936f714ad11e830, attachment at 5f061882972a33c9b3578b61a6c835495e41d4ad). Preserve the original scope: composable authority boundaries, lane as full work conversation, several contributors, exact recombination into a mergeable deployable Git change, familiar GitHub experience, and no production rollout. Reuse existing owners rather than changing accepted commitments. No source implementation, install, typecheck, runtime probe, deployment or live human notification is requested. Supply exact retained design artifacts, a decision/owner/dependency table, compact acceptance witnesses and proposed implementation lanes. Independent exact review/adoption precedes implementation. The 10× test-overhead integration, acts, actual builder-identified Jam blockers, builder-positive first-useful-task readiness and Jam/full manual in parallel keep their priorities; this is queued successor design, not a first-Jam gate. Resolve 017 D7 and turn A1–A9 into a reviewable future proof/acceptance plan; execute no runtime now. Bind every witness to S1–S3 semantics and exact supported package/deployed placement versions. Specify a small real multi-DO graph with durable relationship delivery, two contributors, exact split/join/combined-check failure, independent progress under one slow lane or receiver, and a recoverable same-destination publication. Distinguish local RPC/DO fidelity, hosted repository/sandbox effects, production autonomous C3 dispatch and public-package cold use. Reuse N3's starter/conformance/public-install evidence, C6's deployed cross-device journey and N6's full manual; neither a mock workspace nor a quickstart closes those obligations. Define one/ten/one-hundred independently active lanes, shared-destination and